,-0.01802868,0.01728726,-0.08759104,0.05985983,0.03540688,0.16838878,-0.05428706,0.01786268,0.02873809,0.00933158,-0.03053596,0.04114767,-0.02860716,-0.00782978,0.0226573,0.08926395,-0.01696995,0.0208224,0.04545759,-0.01266079,-0.03274387,-0.02695351,-0.03790322,0.03697059,0.00965745,-0.0280717,-0.01478683,0.09446902,0.01799207,-0.02538811,-0.09544396,0.00206193,-0.0299351,-0.01182717,-0.00629974,-0.00356931,-0.024231,-0.01632611,-0.03439739,0.01495565,-0.0125914,-0.02167737,-0.02039494,-0.01248892,-0.01485546,0.02792239,0.11547928,-0.01158621],"last_embed":{"hash":"xsscv0","tokens":444}}},"last_read":{"hash":"xsscv0","at":1778067900882},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1774939523000,"size":4155,"at":1778067900883,"hash":"xsscv0"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,18],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions":[20,46],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#{1}":[21,25],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#📝 Benim Notlarım":[26,32],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#📝 Benim Notlarım#{1}":[27,28],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#📝 Benim Notlarım#{2}":[29,32],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🟡 Genel Bilgiler (Sarı)":[33,35],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)":[36,38],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🟢 Yöntem & Örneklem (Yeşil)#{1}":[37,38],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)":[39,41],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🔴 Bulgular (Kırmızı)#{1}":[40,41],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)":[42,44],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🔵 Sonuç / Conclusions (Mavi)#{1}":[43,44],"#Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions#🟠 Limitasyonlar (Turuncu)":[45,46]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Görüntüle","target":"zotero://select/library/items/MDYR639L","line":22},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/APRMXMCU?page=1&annotation=YN2YQXXT","line":37},{"title":"Sayfa 1","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/APRMXMCU?page=1&annotation=2GLSR5QC","line":40},{"title":"Sayfa 8","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/APRMXMCU?page=8&annotation=4VCRGXJM","line":43},{"title":"Sayfa 8","target":"zotero://open-pdf/library/items/APRMXMCU?page=8&annotation=WTBDTV7F","line":43}],"metadata":{"Title":"Comparison of Answers between ChatGPT and Human Dieticians to Common Nutrition Questions","Authors":"Daniel Kirk, Elise Van Eijnatten, Guido Camps","Year":2023,"DOI":"10.1155/2023/5548684","Nitelik":null,"Alan":null,"Konu":null,"AI_Methodology":null,"Layer_Focus":null,"Model_Asamasi":null,"Proposed_Tool":null,"Methods":"Dieticians were asked to provide their most commonly asked nutrition questions and their own answers to them. We then asked the same questions to ChatGPTand sent both sets of answers to other dieticians (N � 18) or nutritionists and experts in the domain of each question (N � 9) to be graded based on scientifc correctness, actionability, and comprehensibility","Findings":"Te overall grades for ChatGPT were higher than those from the dieticians for the overall scores in fve of the eight questions we received. ChatGPT also had higher grades on fve occasions for scientifc correctness, four for actionability, and fve for comprehensibility. In contrast, none of the answers from the dieticians had a higher average score than ChatGPT for any of the questions, both overall and for each of the grading components.","Conclusions":"ChatGPT is virtually free, accessible at any time, and provides answers almost instantly, which are all advantages over human nutrition experts. Investigating the ability of ChatGPT and similar applications to ofer nutrition and health support is imperative given the current trajectory of the use of chatbots in everyday lifeWe have shown that the general-purpose chatbot ChatGPT is at least as good as human dieticians at answering common nutrition questions that might be asked to a nutrition expert.  Future work should investigate the potential of chatbots to provide information to educate and improve the dietary habits of users","Limitations":"","User_Notes":"dyt ile karşılaştırma var  dyt=ai  prompt var"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[],"last_embed":{"hash":"xsscv0","at":1774939754461},"key":"Augmented Dietitian/kirkComparisonAnswersChatGPT2023c.md"},
